ection in the near term.","context":"•the current environment in capital markets combined with our capital constraints may prevent us from being able to obtain adequate debt financing; and","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":161,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001698530-26-000028","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001698530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1698530/000169853026000028/xcur-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4713994fcf692d0bddf160a72d74d5b3367dc2b180433b45e72b2fe277ffc00a.bin","sha256":"4713994fcf692d0bddf160a72d74d5b3367dc2b180433b45e72b2fe277ffc00a"}},{"id":"d8db93b00957b8f1f02d13f59012f4748f9de3a3cb4a6caa9b3d7cceb9f5b62f","quote":"Our common stock may be delisted from Nasdaq which could negatively impact the price of our common stock, liquidity and our ability to access the capital markets.","context":"•if we fail to obtain required additional financing to grow our business we may need to seek bankruptcy protection in the near term.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":162,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001698530-26-000028","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-25","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001698530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1698530/000169853026000028/xcur-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4713994fcf692d0bddf160a72d74d5b3367dc2b180433b45e72b2fe277ffc00a.bin","sha256":"4713994fcf692d0bddf160a72d74d5b3367dc2b180433b45e72b2fe277ffc00a"}},{"id":"5d3da8badbdc86227fe57329ba039f1a5d1f46c3a70de9a18f0f380b2a02b260","quote":"Our common stock is currently listed on Nasdaq under the symbol “XCUR.” As previously disclosed, we have received numerous deficiency notices with respect to various Nasdaq listing requirements in the past years. Most recently, on May 21, 2025, the Comp